  Th2HandbookHelp_L("`SAVE " + Chr(34) + "<filename>" + Chr(34) + "[, A]`  |  Command  |  Saves a program. The program is saved in ASCII format when " + Chr(34) + "A" + Chr(34) + " is specified.")
