  Th2HandbookHelp_Commit("_Figure 4.70  Readout of the conflict coordinate_", "Chapter 4: VDP and display screen (1-5)")
  Th2HandbookHelp_AddAnchor("Chapter4a#_figure-470-readout-of-the-conflict-coordinate_", 485)

  Th2HandbookHelp_Begin()
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@    (X-coordinate where the conflict occurred) = (X-coordinate of S#3 and S#4) - 12")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@    (Y-coordinate where the conflict occurred) = (Y-coordinate of S#5 and S#6) - 8")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("When more than nine sprites are placed on the same horizontal line, bit 6 of S#0 becomes " + Chr(34) + "1" + Chr(34) + " and the number of the sprite plane whose order of priority is 9 is entered to the 5 low order bits of S#0 (see [[[Figure 4.71|||Chapter4a#figure-471--conflict-of-the-sprite-sprite-mode-2]]]).")
  Th2HandbookHelp_Commit("_Expression 4.5  Calculating the actual conflict coordinate_", "Chapter 4: VDP and display screen (1-5)")
  Th2HandbookHelp_AddAnchor("Chapter4a#_expression-45-calculating-the-actual-conflict-coordinate_", 486)

  Th2HandbookHelp_Begin()
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@    MSB   7    6    5    4    3    2    1    0    LSB")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@        -----------------------------------------")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@S#0     | .  | X  | .  | X  | X  | X  | X  | X  |")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@        -----------------------------------------")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@               |       |                        |")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@               |       +------------------------+")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@               |     contains the 9th sprite number")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@               |")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@               |    0: normal")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@               +-->")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@                    1: more than 9 sprites are occupying the same line")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("@@@")
  Th2HandbookHelp_Commit("_Figure 4.71  Conflict of the sprite (sprite mode 2)_", "Chapter 4: VDP and display screen (1-5)")
  Th2HandbookHelp_AddAnchor("Chapter4a#_figure-471-conflict-of-the-sprite-sprite-mode-2_", 487)

  Th2HandbookHelp_Begin()
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[Figure 4.3|||Chapter4a#figure-43--indirect-access-to-rn-non-autoincrement-mode]]], " + Chr(34) + "Port#17" + Chr(34) + " indication is corrected to " + Chr(34) + "R#17" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[Figure 4.4|||Chapter4a#figure-44--indirect-access-to-rn-autoincrement-mode]]], " + Chr(34) + "00" + Chr(34) + " field in R#17 is corrected to " + Chr(34) + "10" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[section 3.2.2|||Chapter4a#322-screen-structure-of-text-2]]], subsection [[[" + Chr(34) + "Pattern name table" + Chr(34) + "|||Chapter4a#pattern-name-table-1]]], text " + Chr(34) + "12 low order bits o the address (A9 to A0)" + Chr(34) + " is corrected to " + Chr(34) + "12 low order bits of the address (A11 to A0)" + Chr(34))
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[Figure 4.17|||Chapter4a#figure-417--structure-of-text2-pattern-name-table]]], the numerations of the two last rows in the Screen correspondence table, originally " + Chr(34) + "22" + Chr(34) + " and " + Chr(34) + "23" + Chr(34) + ", are corrected to " + Chr(34) + "25" + Chr(34) + " and " + Chr(34) + "26" + Chr(34) + " respectively.")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[section 3.2.2|||Chapter4a#322-screen-structure-of-text-2]]], subsection [[[" + Chr(34) + "Blink table" + Chr(34) + "|||Chapter4a#blink-table]]], the text " + Chr(34) + "the 9 low order bits of the address (A9 to A0)" + Chr(34) + " is corrected to " + Chr(34) + "the 8 low order bits of the address (A8 to A0)" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[Figure 4.25|||Chapter4a#figure-425--border-colour-specification]]], indication " + Chr(34) + "Specifies the value of the screen (0 to 15)" + Chr(34) + " is changed to " + Chr(34) + "Specifies the border colour (0-15)" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[Figure 4.34|||Chapter4a#figure-434--pattern-name-table-for-graphic-modes-2-and-3]]], in the screen correspondance table, the three stages of the screen are named " + Chr(34) + "Upper stage of screen" + Chr(34) + " in the original. This is corrected, and the stages are named " + Chr(34) + "Upper" + Chr(34) + ", " + Chr(34) + "Middle" + Chr(34) + " and " + Chr(34) + "Lower" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- The title of [[[section 3.6.3|||Chapter4a#363-screen-colour-specification]]] is " + Chr(34) + "Screen colour mode specification" + Chr(34) + " in the original. The word " + Chr(34) + "mode" + Chr(34) + " is erased.")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[section 3.8.2|||Chapter4a#382-pattern-name-table]]], the text " + Chr(34) + "by writing the 2 high order bits" + Chr(34) + " is corrected to " + Chr(34) + "by writing the high order bit" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- The title of [[[Figure 4.63|||Chapter4a#figure-463--judging-the-conflict-sprite-mode-1]]] is " + Chr(34) + "Judging the conflict (sprite mode 2)" + Chr(34) + " in the original. This is corrected to " + Chr(34) + "Judging the conflict (sprite mode 1)" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("- In [[[Figure 4.68|||Chapter4a#figure-468--cc-bit-detection]]], indication " + Chr(34) + "Color code = 8 or 4 or 12" + Chr(34) + " is changed to " + Chr(34) + "Color code = 8 or 4 = 12" + Chr(34) + ".")
  Th2HandbookHelp_Commit("Changes from the original:", "Chapter 4: VDP and display screen (1-5)")
  Th2HandbookHelp_AddAnchor("Chapter4a#changes-from-the-original", 488)

  Th2HandbookHelp_Begin()
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("MSX-VIDEO can execute basic graphic operations, which are called VDP commands. These are done by accessing special harware and are available in the GRAPHIC 4 to GRAPHIC 7 modes. These graphic commands have been made easy to implement, requiring only that the necessary parameters be set in the proper registers before invoking them. This section describes these VDP commands.")
  Th2HandbookHelp_Commit("6. VDP COMMAND USAGE", "Chapter 4: VDP and display screen (6)")
  Th2HandbookHelp_AddAnchor("Chapter4b#6-vdp-command-usage", 489)

  Th2HandbookHelp_Begin()
