  Th2HandbookHelp_L("* **Input**: none")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("* **Output**: HL for the starting address of the buffer minus 1, the CY flag is set only when it ends with the STOP key.")
  Th2HandbookHelp_L("* **Registers**: all")
