  Th2HandbookHelp_L("[[[Figure A.5|||Appendix4#figure-a5--work-area]]] shows the map of the MSX2 work area. In this section, the system work area and hook from F380H to FFCAH in the figure are described. The following notation is used. Length is in bytes.")
